{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00537","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 南吕羽 · 韩休","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 南吕羽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於穆濬哲，维清缉熙。\n肃事昭配，永言孝思。\n涤濯静嘉，馨香在兹。\n神之听之，用受福厘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}